expected_issues.description:
Missing validation for empty method name. When a checker method name ends with '$$' (e.g., 'check$ClassName$$'), the code extracts an empty method name, which is invalid. Consider adding validation after method name extraction:
```java
if (!targetMethodIsCtor && targetMethodName.isEmpty()) {
    throw new IllegalArgumentException(
        String.format(Locale.ROOT, "Checker method %s has no method name", checkerMethodName)
    );
}
```

